<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>PADI Form 10175 - EU Statement of Risk and Liability</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a202c; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #2b6cb0; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .meta { background-color: #ebf8ff; border: 1px solid #bee3f8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .meta p { margin: 4px 0; }
    .clause { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; text-align: justify; }
    .signature-box { border: 1px solid #cbd5e0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; background-color: #f7fafc; margin-top: 24px; }
    .signature-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>PADI Form 10175 — Statement of Risk and Liability (EU Version)</h1>
  
  <div class="meta">
    <p><strong>Participant Name:</strong> {{ diver_full_name }}</p>
    <p><strong>Diving Center:</strong> {{ diving_center_name }}</p>
    <p><strong>Dive Activity / Date:</strong> {{ dive_date }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="clause">
    <p>This is a statement in which you are informed of the risks of skin and scuba diving. The statement also informs you of the reasons why you should participate in safety precautions.</p>
    <p>I, <strong>{{ diver_full_name }}</strong>, understand that skin and scuba diving have inherent risks which may result in serious injury or death.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="clause">
    <p>I understand that diving with compressed air involves specific risks: decompression sickness, embolism or other hyperbaric injuries. I understand that diving in open water requires safe diving practices, continuous monitoring of air supply and depth, maintaining buddy contact, and adhering to the dive briefings delivered by <strong>{{ diving_center_name }}</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-box">
    <p><strong>Acknowledgement of Inherent Risk</strong></p>
    <p>I acknowledge that I have read and understood this statement of risk, and that I accept the inherent hazards of participating in recreational diving activities.</p>
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div><strong>Participant Signature:</strong> {{ diver_full_name }}</div>
      <div><strong>Date:</strong> {{ signed_at or "Today" }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
